{"id":"tesouro","lemma":"tesouro","pos":"noun","rank":1577,"glosses":["treasure (collection of valuable things)","Treasury (department responsible for management of public revenue)","treasure (any single thing that one values greatly)"],"ipa":"/teˈzo(w).ɾu/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/f/f8/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-tesouro.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-tesouro.wav.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"tesouros"},"examples":[{"text":"Tom encontrou o tesouro.","en":"Tom found the treasure.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to meet","l":"encontrar"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"O tesouro poderia estar em qualquer lugar.","en":"The treasure could be anywhere.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to be able to","l":"poder"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"any"},{"g":"place"}]},{"text":"Dizem que há tesouros escondidos lá.","en":"It's rumored there are treasures hidden there.","words":[{"g":"to speak","l":"dizer"},{"g":"that / what"},{"g":"there be","l":"haver"},null,{"g":"hidden","l":"escondido"},{"g":"there"}]},{"text":"Nós não enterramos o tesouro aqui.","en":"We didn't bury the treasure here.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"not / no"},{"g":"to bury","l":"enterrar"},{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Estávamos procurando um tesouro enterrado.","en":"We were looking for buried treasure.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to search","l":"procurar"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"buried"}]}]}